        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Princess Margaretha of Liechtenstein, Henri, Grand Duke of Luxembourg, Prince Jean of Luxembourg, Prince Hans-Adam II of Liechtenstein\n- Organizations: Luxembourg reigning dynasty, Liechtenstein reigning dynasty\n- Places: Luxembourg, Liechtenstein\n- Roles: Grand Duke of Luxembourg, princess\n\nFacts:\n- Henri, Grand Duke of Luxembourg, was born on 16 April 1955.\n- Henri has reigned as the current Grand Duke of Luxembourg since 7 October 2000.\n- Prince Jean of Luxembourg is the twin brother of Princess Margaretha of Liechtenstein.\n- Princess Margaretha of Liechtenstein is the sister of Grand Duke Henri of Luxembourg.\n- Princess Margaretha of Liechtenstein is the sister-in-law of Prince Hans-Adam II of Liechtenstein.\n- Princess Margaretha of Liechtenstein is a princess of both Luxembourg and Liechtenstein and a member of the reigning dynasties of both realms.",
